<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Australia 2006 T-bond yld averages 7.396 pct.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Australia 2006 T-bond yld averages 7.396 pct.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1997-02-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results of today's A$900 million T-bond tender, announced by Reserve Bank of Australia (RBA):</p>
<p>  Stock	  Offering     Allotted	Avg yield   Range</p>
<p>  6.75 Nov 06  AS600 million    A$600 million     7.396     7.38-7.41</p>
<p>		   (RBA take-up nil, pct allotted at top 50)</p>
<p>  Stock	  Offering     Allotted	Avg yield   Range</p>
<p>8.75 Jan 01  AS300 million    A$301 million     6.812     6.81-6.82</p>
<p>		   (RBA take-up nil, pct allotted at top 10)</p>
<p>-- Sydney newsroom 61-2 9373-1800</p>
</text>
